    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="class_component_ordering" kindref="compound">ComponentOrdering</ref> describes the lower and upper component indices for a given solver. For now, all solvers work in a monolithic fashion, solving their complete system of PDEs in a unique coupled system.</para>
<para>Each derived class must specify the [lower, upper) interval for its variables.</para>
<para>FIXME: These orderings should be known at compile time. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
